    "body": "STOPPED after two failing quick gate runs. Claim released.\n\nThe new structural pin fails on unchanged upstream/main 98f093fba. The repeat control has a caption Label and an unnamed CheckBox. The pin is thread_passes_repeat_each_depth_checkbox_has_label_role_and_enabled_state.\n\nA trial in layout/form.rs::check_row sets the checkbox AccessKit label and associates its caption. Restoring the old helper makes the pin fail. Restoring the trial makes it pass. No NC or CL goldens changed.\n\nThe first quick gate exposed duplicate label matches with the explicit name alone. Adding labelled_by clears those failures. The second quick gate still fails click_apply_edits_operation_through_commands: checkbox did not reach the staged params. The query now targets the checkbox instead of its caption. This click regression needs investigation before a PR.\n\nUncommitted trial code and the pin remain in .claude/worktrees/issue-1848 on branch issue/1848-repeat-depth-structure in the mkinney checkout. Nothing was pushed. No PR was opened. The issue is free again.\n",
